# Themed popups

Never use `window.alert`, `window.confirm`, or `window.prompt`. Those follow the OS/browser, not MyCRM.

Use `useDialog()` from `@/components/shell/dialogs`:
- `await confirm(message)` for OK / Cancel
- `await alert(message)` (or `void alert(...)`) for OK-only

Form / work-surface overlays use `PopupWindow` from `@/components/shell/PopupWindow` (navy title bar, white body, footer Cancel + navy primary). Confirm/alert use the same chrome at `z-[200]`.

Do not hand-roll a second overlay style. Import Clients is the visual reference.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
const ok = window.confirm("The selected Lead(s) will be permanently deleted. Do you wish to continue?");
<div className="fixed inset-0 ..."><div className="bg-white p-4">...</div></div>

// ✅ GOOD
const { confirm, alert } = useDialog();
const ok = await confirm("The selected Lead(s) will be permanently deleted. Do you wish to continue?");
if (!ok) return;

<PopupWindow title="Import Clients" onClose={...} footer={...}>
  ...
</PopupWindow>
```

Shared reference: `Design Rules.md` → Popups.
